WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:03.400
-Welcome back, everybody.
We're hanging with our pal

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:05.467
Kevin James, who stars in the
new Netflix film "Home Team."

00:00:05.467 --> 00:00:09.200
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:11.300
It's coming out tomorrow.
I want to ask you also about

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:13.400
another project
that you're doing.

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:18.033
You did a local production
of "Oliver."

00:00:18.033 --> 00:00:21.701
-Yes. Yeah, I took a page out of
Sean Payton's playbook.

00:00:21.701 --> 00:00:24.801
I did a --
My kids were asking me

00:00:24.801 --> 00:00:26.601
if I could be
in a play with them.

00:00:26.601 --> 00:00:30.400
So I said, "Yeah, I would love
to do a small part

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:32.467
where I just come in and say
hello kind of"

00:00:32.467 --> 00:00:34.667
and have a little fun
in the play with them.

00:00:34.667 --> 00:00:37.334
It turned out to be --
We did "Oliver."

00:00:37.334 --> 00:00:40.701
I'd never seen "Oliver" but I'm
playing Fagin in "Oliver,"

00:00:40.701 --> 00:00:42.200
which is a pretty big part, man.

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:44.067
I didn't know
how involved it was.

00:00:44.067 --> 00:00:45.234
It's the hardest
I've ever worked for

00:00:45.234 --> 00:00:46.601
anything in my career.

00:00:46.601 --> 00:00:47.901
I'm honest.

00:00:47.901 --> 00:00:49.567
Have you ever done live theater?

00:00:49.567 --> 00:00:51.067
-Never. No, no, no.

00:00:51.067 --> 00:00:52.868
I couldn't remember the lines.

00:00:52.868 --> 00:00:54.667
-Exactly.
Well, you can sing, though.

00:00:54.667 --> 00:00:57.467
You can dance.
There's all of this in there.

00:00:57.467 --> 00:00:59.901
And I'm just --
I'm horrendous with it.

00:00:59.901 --> 00:01:01.968
And it was like --
It's frightening.

00:01:01.968 --> 00:01:03.200
And these kids are amazing.

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:04.767
The whole group is really good,

00:01:04.767 --> 00:01:06.267
so there's a lot
of pressure on me.

00:01:06.267 --> 00:01:07.901
And we had some fun doing it.

00:01:07.901 --> 00:01:11.801
But I'm just not, you know,
a musical guy and all that.

00:01:11.801 --> 00:01:13.200
It's literally the hardest --

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:15.200
Double rehearsals,
like tech week.

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:17.000
The whole thing, live audience.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:19.267
It's a panic fest.

00:01:19.267 --> 00:01:22.267
-Do your kids school you
to any new music?

00:01:22.267 --> 00:01:24.000
Do you get to hear music
through your kids?

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:26.501
-I hear tons of music now.

00:01:26.501 --> 00:01:28.868
I mean,
the radio's always going along.

00:01:28.868 --> 00:01:30.100
-Anything you're listening to
now?

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:32.400
-The one song that's in my head
constantly is

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:35.067
the one that -- buh-buh-duh-duh.

00:01:35.067 --> 00:01:36.567
F you.

00:01:36.567 --> 00:01:42.634
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.634 --> 00:01:46.200
-How dare you.

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:50.667
How dare you say that to me?!

00:01:53.334 --> 00:01:54.734
-Are you kidding me?!

00:01:54.734 --> 00:01:56.000
-No, I'm not kidding you at all.

00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:57.167
-I'll throw at you!

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:01.100
[ Laughter ]

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:03.567
-You want to sit down?!

00:02:03.567 --> 00:02:05.701
You want to sit down?! Sit down!

00:02:05.701 --> 00:02:08.601
[ Laughter ]
Sit down!

00:02:08.601 --> 00:02:10.834
-Oh, yeah!
-Yeah!

00:02:10.834 --> 00:02:13.434
-You got to be kidding me, man.
-Oh, yeah?

00:02:13.434 --> 00:02:15.000
-How about a little bit of this
you little --

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:16.400
-Oh!
[ Laughter ]

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:19.234
-Yeah! Yeah!

00:02:19.234 --> 00:02:21.100
-Your movie's on Netflix, huh?

00:02:21.100 --> 00:02:22.133
Well, guess what!

00:02:22.133 --> 00:02:25.601
I'm logged in and the password's
in there!

00:02:25.601 --> 00:02:27.334
-Hey!

00:02:27.334 --> 00:02:29.734
This is your computer?!
How you getting any work done?!

00:02:29.734 --> 00:02:31.334
Is this where
you type your jokes?

00:02:31.334 --> 00:02:33.968
-Oh, yeah?
Don't get wet, buddy!

00:02:35.434 --> 00:02:36.968
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:36.968 --> 00:02:39.501
-Dude, dude, that is not cool!

00:02:39.501 --> 00:02:41.434
-Yeah, it's not cool at all,
man!

00:02:41.434 --> 00:02:43.400
Nothing's cool anymore!

00:02:43.400 --> 00:02:44.701
-Yeah?

00:02:44.701 --> 00:02:46.767
How about a sack of nickels?
[ Coins jingling ]

00:02:46.767 --> 00:02:49.400
You want nickels in the face
with an old sweat sock?!

00:02:54.167 --> 00:02:56.000
[ Laughter ]

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:58.601
-You're lucky you missed me with
that one!

00:02:58.601 --> 00:03:01.067
Is your movie about football?

00:03:01.067 --> 00:03:02.701
-Yeah, it's about football!

00:03:02.701 --> 00:03:06.267
-Yeah, well, here's something
that was on my foot!

00:03:06.267 --> 00:03:08.734
-Oh!
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:08.734 --> 00:03:10.934
Wait a second.

00:03:10.934 --> 00:03:12.634
-Oh, my gosh, I'm thinking about
this now.

00:03:12.634 --> 00:03:15.667
Hey, hey, hey, hey.
I just remembered.

00:03:15.667 --> 00:03:18.634
No, no, no.
It's not "F you."

00:03:18.634 --> 00:03:22.367
It's "abcdefu."

00:03:22.367 --> 00:03:24.634
It's that song by Gayle.

00:03:24.634 --> 00:03:25.968
[ Applause ]
-Oh.

00:03:25.968 --> 00:03:27.033
-Oh!

00:03:27.033 --> 00:03:28.367
-My God.

00:03:28.367 --> 00:03:30.033
-You know that one?

00:03:30.033 --> 00:03:33.300
-What am I doing?
What are we doing?!

00:03:33.300 --> 00:03:35.501
I'm so sorry.
I love you, Kevin.

00:03:35.501 --> 00:03:37.267
I would never want to
do this to you.

00:03:37.267 --> 00:03:38.634
-I love you, man.

00:03:38.634 --> 00:03:41.234
-Thanks, buddy. I appreciate it.
-Yeah.

00:03:41.234 --> 00:03:43.434
But I do have to give you this,
okay?

00:03:45.234 --> 00:03:46.501
-No, no, no, no, no!

00:03:49.734 --> 00:03:52.567
Gosh.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:52.567 --> 00:03:54.501
-Did I miss you?
-No.

00:03:54.501 --> 00:04:03.501
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:03.501 --> 00:04:05.434
Banana cream, my favorite.

00:04:05.434 --> 00:04:07.501
My thanks to Kevin James!

00:04:07.501 --> 00:04:11.501
His new film "Home Team"
premieres tomorrow on Netflix.

00:04:11.501 --> 00:04:12.634
I love you, buddy.

00:04:12.634 --> 00:04:14.300
We'll be right back with
more "Tonight Show."

